("58","Logging Properly","Replace scattered print statements with logging levels, formatters, and useful context.","Production programs need diagnostics that can be controlled without editing code.","Log startup, a successful operation, and an exception.","Logging passwords, tokens, or unnecessary personal data.","Design INFO/WARNING/ERROR messages for one project."),
