("65","Mocking & Dependency Boundaries","Use mocks or fakes at external boundaries such as APIs, files, clocks, and payment systems.","Tests become faster and deterministic when external systems are isolated.","Replace an API client with a fake object in a unit test.","Mocking everything until the test no longer resembles real behavior.","Choose one dependency that genuinely deserves a fake."),
("66","Packaging a Real Project","Understand package layout, pyproject.toml, dependencies, entry points, and reproducible environments.","A project becomes easier to install, test, and share when its structure is deliberate.","Turn a small script into an installable package layout.","Treating a folder of scripts as a maintainable package automatically.","Sketch the files needed for a publishable Python CLI."),
